# @hub-lanes

# ── LEAD REVIEW AUTO-REQUEST (BH-3545) ──────────────────────────────────────
# bin/lead-review-enqueue.sh tick — every 15 min, ask for ONE lead review per
# PR head a builder APPROVE'd in LEAD_REVIEW_AUTO_REPOS, when no lead/human
# verdict stands on that head and no commit carries a Lead-Lane: trailer. The
# review runs on the owning box (bin/lead-review.sh); this lane makes no agent
# call and no SSH. A new request rings lead-review on the owning box through
# the wakes doorbell (BH-4057). Off via flags/lane-off-lead-review-enqueue. Log:
# logs/lead-review-enqueue.log.
*/15 * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/lead-review-enqueue.sh tick >/dev/null 2>&1
